abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for the bibliometric and scientometric analysis of Sustainable Development
  Goal-related research across all 54 African Union member states and all 17 SDGs from 2015 to 2025
  (Scopus articles and reviews; 345,025 publications). Raw Scopus exports are not included because of
  third-party licensing restrictions.
